WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,160
Congratulations, I just reached Level 2

2
00:00:02,160 --> 00:00:04,000
Young Master, how is the situation over there?

3
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:06,160
There are still two hours to go. The monster wave is coming.

4
00:00:09,150 --> 00:00:11,670
Guys, I probably won't make it through today.

5
00:00:11,670 --> 00:00:14,270
I will send supplies to the group before I die

6
00:00:14,270 --> 00:00:15,430
You guys are divided by the looks of it, right?

7
00:00:15,430 --> 00:00:17,590
No, what's going on with you? Don't scare me.

8
00:00:17,590 --> 00:00:19,710
What's wrong with you? Tell me, let's think of something.

9
00:00:24,730 --> 00:00:27,130
What's going on with you? You've been poisoned.

10
00:00:27,130 --> 00:00:28,490
Encountered a silver box

11
00:00:28,490 --> 00:00:30,130
Got a claw dug out by a poisonous monster

12
00:00:30,130 --> 00:00:31,530
Someone wants to talk to me about antidote pills

13
00:00:31,530 --> 00:00:33,410
But want all my upgrade card fragments

14
00:00:33,410 --> 00:00:35,670
I think the tide of monsters is coming and everyone will die if I count them horizontally.

15
00:00:35,790 --> 00:00:37,900
No more wasting materials

16
00:00:37,900 --> 00:00:39,940
I'll give you an antidote pill

17
00:00:39,940 --> 00:00:42,780
Boss, do you really want to save me?

18
00:00:42,780 --> 00:00:44,770
I'm quite useless

19
00:00:44,770 --> 00:00:47,210
I don’t know how I can return this favor to you.

20
00:00:47,210 --> 00:00:49,530
Get some rest. Call me a corpse.

21
00:00:49,530 --> 00:00:51,370
Okay, whatever it is

22
00:00:51,370 --> 00:00:52,570
I will definitely help you get it done
